    "这些项目可能属于已卸载的应用。默认不选；请确认路径并勾选要移到废纸篓的项目。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These items may belong to uninstalled apps. None are selected by default. Review the paths and select items to move to the Trash."
